      <h2><span class="num">01</span> The RDNA family at a glance</h2>
      <p>
        <code>hipfire</code> targets the whole RDNA family with one Rust
        binary; feature predicates over the matrix path are the load-bearing
        piece of its dispatch layer.
      </p>

